        <obo:IAO_0000117>PERSON:Jessica Turner</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:5146491#Oldfield, R.C. (1971). The assessment and analysis of handedness: The Edinburgh inventory. Neuropsychologia, 9, 97-113</obo:IAO_0000119>
